{"id":"strogo","lemma":"строго","pos":"adv","rank":2244,"glosses":["rigorously, strictly, strongly, pronouncedly, religiously, definitely"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cb/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Строго говоря, это ошибка.","en":"This is, strictly speaking, a mistake.","words":[null,null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"mistake, error, fault"}]},{"text":"Мы должны его строго наказать.","en":"We must punish him severely.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"to punish"}]},{"text":"Он должен быть строго наказан.","en":"He must be severely punished.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"to be"},null,null]},{"text":"Всё, что я вам скажу, строго между нами.","en":"What I'm about to say is strictly between you and me.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},null,{"g":"between, among"},{"g":"we","l":"мы"}]},{"text":"Строго говоря, так и есть.","en":"Strictly speaking, that's true.","words":[null,null,{"g":"so"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"there is / to eat"}]}]}